e the fact he is completely aware of it. Later, Popura tries to get Sota to treat Mahiru nicer. Tired of Jun's teasing, Popura tries to get revenge on him which does not go to plan. Meanwhile, Aoi acts very clingy around Otoo after he comes back from his recent trip.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/epCaLE0ErP4DRASFHosGgKxXCMx.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Aoi becomes curious about Hiroomi's secret life and drags Popura into stalking him, despite the fact he is completely aware of it. Later, Popura tries to get Sota to treat Mahiru nicer. Tired of Jun's teasing, Popura tries to get revenge on him which does not go to plan. Meanwhile, Aoi acts very clingy around Otoo after he comes back from his recent trip.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/epCaLE0ErP4DRASFHosGgKxXCMx.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8364","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10521","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"10521","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"46153","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"145211","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"19839","synopsis":"Sōta's novelist sister Izumi enters a slump when she assumes he is dating Popura and will stop paying attention to her. She decides to go on a journey where she ends up meeting Mahiru who helps cheer her up. As Sōta looks after Izumi, Nazuna helps out at Wagnaria, which annoys Aoi who believes she is outshining her. After hearing about it, Nazuna puts on an act to make Aoi feel better about herself.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j6xiNTswyDac5uAGhPTQBPFCuKx.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Sōta's novelist sister Izumi enters a slump when she assumes he is dating Popura and will stop paying attention to her. She decides to go on a journey where she ends up meeting Mahiru who helps cheer her up. As Sōta looks after Izumi, Nazuna helps out at Wagnaria, which annoys Aoi who believes she is outshining her. After hearing about it, Nazuna puts on an act to make Aoi feel better about herself.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j6xiNTswyDac5uAGhPTQBPFCuKx.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8364","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10521","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"10521","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"46153","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"145211","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"19838","synopsis":"Whilst out shopping for some more cream, Kyōko and Yachiyo end up meeting Otoo's long lost wife, Haruna. As Yachiyo debates whether to tell Kyōko about her, she disappears again. As Yachiyo feels guilty about it, Mahiru learns about Jun's one-sided crush on Yachiyo and starts feeling sorry for him, leading Sōta to believe she has a crush on Jun. With some support from Jun, Yachiyo apologises to Otoo after he returns and cheers up.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/doJGWpTLbfzy62elhZc91wYeJb4.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Whilst out shopping for some more cream, Kyōko and Yachiyo end up meeting Otoo's long lost wife, Haruna. As Yachiyo debates whether to tell Kyōko about her, she disappears again. As Yachiyo feels guilty about it, Mahiru learns about Jun's one-sided crush on Yachiyo and starts feeling sorry for him, leading Sōta to believe she has a crush on Jun. With some support from Jun, Yachiyo apologises to Otoo after he returns and cheers up.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/doJGWpTLbfzy62elhZc91wYeJb4.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8364","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10521","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"10521","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"46153","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"145211","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"19842","synopsis":"Popura and the others try to think of ways to help Sōta get along better with Kyōko. Wanting to be spoiled in a similar manner to Kyōko, Aoi starts learning how to make parfaits, much to the dismay of Jun. In order to stop Kyōko from eating everything in the store, Hiyoomi tells a white lie which leaves her stunned. When Sōta finds a lost girl, Kyōko is told to look after her, and even avoids taking her food. After the girl is reunited with her mother, Jun gives Kyōko some food as thanks.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/feTyEq1jhX0G4U2GexTXhCDDPZ3.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Popura and the others try to think of ways to help Sōta get along better with Kyōko. Wanting to be spoiled in a similar manner to Kyōko, Aoi starts learning how to make parfaits, much to the dismay of Jun. In order to stop Kyōko from eating everything in the store, Hiyoomi tells a white lie which leaves her stunned. When Sōta finds a lost girl, Kyōko is told to look after her, and even avoids taking her food. After the girl is reunited with her mother, Jun gives Kyōko some food as thanks.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/feTyEq1jhX0G4U2GexTXhCDDPZ3.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8364","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10521","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"10521","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"46153","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"145211","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"19840","synopsis":"Popura and Jun end up catching colds due to Aoi's clumsiness, so Kyōko calls in two of her juniors, Yohei and Mitsuki Mashiba, twin siblings who don't get along. When Kyōko offers to put someone else in charge of looking after Inami, Sōta becomes upset and falls out with Inami, but Inami soon manages to build up the courage to make up with him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kLbqTMOX76vJz5oEYmhF3PWA7gJ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Popura and Jun end up catching colds due to Aoi's clumsiness, so Kyōko calls in two of her juniors, Yohei and Mitsuki Mashiba, twin siblings who don't get along. When Kyōko offers to put someone else in charge of looking after Inami, Sōta becomes upset and falls out with Inami, but Inami soon manages to build up the courage to make up with him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kLbqTMOX76vJz5oEYmhF3PWA7gJ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8364","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10521","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"10521","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"46153","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"145211","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"19847","synopsis":"Mahiru meets a boy calling himself Kirio Yamada, who she believes might be Aoi's brother. As he is able to withstand her punches, Mahiru ends up conversing well with Kirio, who starts developing feelings for her, but Sōta becomes downhearted when he sees the two getting along. He begins acting strangely the next day and ends up bashing his head against the wall, leading him to think he might've become a masochist. Later, Kozue manages to get the waitresses to dress up in animal cosplay.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2AhSt73vUtH6cFue2JkcfGnZarl.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Mahiru meets a boy calling himself Kirio Yamada, who she believes might be Aoi's brother. As he is able to withstand her punches, Mahiru ends up conversing well with Kirio, who starts developing feelings for her, but Sōta becomes downhearted when he sees the two getting along. He begins acting strangely the next day and ends up bashing his head against the wall, leading him to think he might've become a masochist. Later, Kozue manages to get the waitresses to dress up in animal cosplay.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2AhSt73vUtH6cFue2JkcfGnZarl.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8364","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10521","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"10521","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"46153","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"145211","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"19848","synopsis":"Sōta becomes depressed when he discovers Nazuna has grown as tall as him and has Popura act like his little sister for the day. Mahiru becomes jealous of this and works with Hiroomi to try and get Sōta to call her cute. The next day, Kirio comes to Wagnaria to look for his sister, but finds himself coming into conflict with the men, whilst Hiroomi attempts to keep him and Aoi from meeting each other.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5CnRKWbsmqvwKQGK2sWslf2VTMY.jpg","metadataSour